```

---

## Common Mistakes to Avoid

| ❌ Don't | ✅ Do |
|----------|------|
| Update only hsqldb scripts | Update all three database scripts |
| Use `AUTO_INCREMENT` in HSQLDB | Use `INTEGER IDENTITY` |
| Forget indexes on FK columns | Always create indexes for FKs |
| Put seed data in initDB.sql | Put seed data in populateDB.sql |
| Create child tables before parents | Order tables by dependencies |
